          "lessonNote": "Eleven communes south-west of Alba, five of which hold most of the vineyard: La Morra and Barolo on the softer Tortonian marl to the west, Castiglione Falletto, Serralunga d'Alba and Monforte d'Alba on the harder Serravallian ground to the east. All Nebbiolo, 38 months with 18 in wood, 13% minimum."
